<title>USA: Market Guide sees Q2 revenues down.</title>
<headline>Market Guide sees Q2 revenues down.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market Guide Inc said Thursday that second fiscal quarter revenues may be down compared to the first quarter, while earnings may &quot;compare unfavorably&quot; with last year's second quarter.</p>
<p>The company said it anticipates steady growth over the next few years from new vendor relations established with Reuters Holdings Plc and Reality Online.</p>
<p>Market Guide compiles a database on more than 8,200 publicly traded domestic and foreign companies.</p>
